Mr. Speaker. I wdsh to table the report on the operation of the Bretton AVoods Agreements Act. 1945, statutes of Canada, 1945, chapter 11, section 7, including:
1.	First annual meeting of the board of governors, held at Washington, D.C., September 27-October 8, 1946, of the International Bank for Reconstruction and Development- proceedings and related documents;
2.	First annual meeting of the board of governors of the international monetary fund, held at Washington, D.C., November, 1946- report of the executive directors and summary' proceedings, September 27-October 3. 1946;
3.	By-laws, rules and regulations of the international monetary fund as amended to March 1, 1947.
